WEBVTT

00:12:27.546 --> 00:12:31.493
But properly understood
and wisely practiced,

00:12:31.517 --> 00:12:35.725
identity politics should expand
our idea of what it is to be human.

00:12:36.223 --> 00:12:42.001
Identity itself should be
not a smug label or a gold medal,

00:12:42.617 --> 00:12:43.970
but a revolution.

00:12:44.848 --> 00:12:47.809
I would have had an easier life
if I were straight,

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:49.697
but I would not be me.

00:12:50.182 --> 00:12:52.859
And I now like being myself better

00:12:52.883 --> 00:12:54.993
than the idea of being someone else,

00:12:55.017 --> 00:12:56.642
someone who, to be honest,

00:12:56.666 --> 00:13:00.560
I have neither the option of being
nor the ability fully to imagine.